# OpenBao paths this realm's in-cluster config expects to exist, seeded by
# nordri bootstrap Layer 5b on a fresh cluster (lib/openbao.sh): one line per
# KV v2 path, then the key names. Each key gets a freshly generated random
# value the first time the path is absent; an existing path is never touched,
# so rotation is an explicit `bao kv put`, never a re-bootstrap.
#
# Values are born in OpenBao and read by workloads through External Secrets
# (cluster/keycloak/oidc-realm-secrets.yaml); nothing here is a value.
#
# Outside cluster/ on purpose: ArgoCD syncs cluster/, and this file is input to
# a workstation script, not a manifest.

# leidangr OIDC: the openbao-cli confidential client and the seeded dev user
# (cluster/keycloak/realm-import.yaml)
secret/leidangr/oidc client-secret dev-user-password
